# MathTiba runs fully functionally with NO environment variables set.
# - All math verification (app/api/verify, app/api/check-answer) is
#   exact BigInt arithmetic in TypeScript. Zero external services.
# - The real-NECTA-question corpus (data/necta-corpus.json) ships
#   pre-built with the app. No fetching happens at runtime.
#
# Optional: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
#   Enables the AI-generated session summary on /report
#   (app/api/explain) and the Socratic hint agent on /practice
#   (app/api/hint). Both are strictly generative-layer: they phrase or
#   nudge, never verify or compute. Without this key, both features
#   fall back to an equivalent deterministic alternative -- nothing
#   breaks either way.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
#
# Optional: GEMINI_API_KEY
#   Upgrades RAG retrieval (app/api/rag/search, app/api/rag/answer)
#   from a deterministic keyword-overlap fallback to real semantic
#   embedding search, and enables the AI-phrased tutor response in
#   app/api/rag/answer (still strictly grounded in retrieved sources
#   only -- it is instructed never to invent a NECTA question, answer,
#   or mark). Without this key, /api/rag/search still works (keyword
#   mode) and /api/rag/answer returns the real retrieved sources with
#   no AI-generated prose.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=...
#
# engine/verify.py + vercel.json are an optional SymPy mirror of the
# TypeScript verifier, for Vercel Python Functions deployments. Not
# required and not called by the frontend by default.
